---
import { scenarios } from '../../data/site';
---

<figure class="loop" aria-labelledby="loop-caption" data-closed-loop>
  <div class="top mono">
    <span class="label">Fig. 1 — The closed loop</span>
    <span class="tag-illustrative">Illustrative</span>
  </div>
  <div class="canvas-wrap">
    <canvas
      role="img"
      aria-label="Illustrative animation. Spikes from five sensors — soil moisture, air temperature and humidity, light, CO2 and soil EC — stream into a 5-32-16-3 spiking network. Every five simulated minutes one forward pass ripples through the network and updates three actuators: irrigation pump, LED intensity and nutrient dosing."
      data-loop-canvas></canvas>
  </div>
  <div class="bar">
    <div class="scenarios" role="group" aria-label="Illustrative scenario">
      {
        scenarios.map((s, i) => (
          <button type="button" data-scenario={s.id} aria-pressed={i === 0 ? 'true' : 'false'}>
            {s.label}
          </button>
        ))
      }
    </div>
    <div class="readout">
      <span data-loop-readout>Decision 073 / 288 · 06:05</span>
      <button type="button" class="pause" aria-pressed="false" data-loop-pause>
        <svg width="12" height="12" viewBox="0 0 12 12" aria-hidden="true">
          <path d="M3 2v8M9 2v8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" fill="none" data-loop-pause-icon></path>
        </svg>
        <span data-loop-pause-label>Pause</span>
      </button>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption id="loop-caption">
    Illustrative animation, not model output: spike timings, network activity and actuator levels are generated to
    explain the idea, not recorded from NeuroFarm’s policy or hardware. The four scenarios are the ones the real policy
    is trained and tested under.
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<script>
  import { mountClosedLoop } from '../../scripts/closed-loop';
  document.querySelectorAll<HTMLElement>('[data-closed-loop]').forEach(mountClosedLoop);
</script>

<style>
  .loop {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 16px;
    padding: clamp(16px, 2vw, 28px);
    background: var(--panel);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
  }
  .top {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
  }
  .canvas-wrap {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
  }
  canvas {
    width: 100%;
  }
  .bar {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 12px 16px;
  }
  .scenarios {
    display: flex;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 8px;
  }
  button {
    min-height: 40px;
    padding: 0 12px;
    background: transparent;
    border: 1px solid var(--line-2);
    border-radius: 2px;
    color: var(--text-2);
    font-family: var(--sans);
    font-size: 14px;
    cursor: pointer;
  }
  button:hover {
    border-color: var(--border);
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .scenarios button[aria-pressed='true'] {
    border-color: var(--accent);
    color: var(--accent);
  }
  .readout {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 12px;
    font-family: var(--mono);
    font-size: 12px;
    letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--muted);
  }
  .pause {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    font-size: 13px;
  }
  figcaption {
    font-size: 14px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 1100px) {
    .loop {
      max-width: 720px;
    }
  }
  @media (max-width: 640px) {
    .bar {
      flex-direction: column;
      align-items: flex-start;
    }
  }
</style>
